Keep a shared wantednode as 0.
Keep a shared foundnum as 0.
Keep a shared foundden as 0.
Keep a shared done as 0.
Keep a shared rendered as empty text.

To seek from node (a whole number) at num (a whole number) with den (a whole number).
If done is 1, return.
If node is wantednode, set foundnum to num, set foundden to den, set done to 1, return.
For every edge from 0 to 3.
The source is item edge of lefts.
The dest is item edge of rights.
The factor is 0.
The divisor is 0.
If source is node and item dest of visited is 0.
Set factor to item edge of numerators.
Set divisor to item edge of denominators.
Set item dest of visited to 1.
The newnum is num times factor.
The newden is den times divisor.
Seek from dest at newnum with newden.

To expand from divisor (a whole number) with left (a whole number).
If divisor is 0, return.
The part is left divided by divisor.
The piece is format whole number part as text.
Place piece into rendered.
The rest is left modulo divisor.
Expand from divisor divided by 10 with rest.

The starts is a list of 0, 1, 0, 0, and 4.
The ends is a list of 2, 0, 3, 0, and 4.
The scaled is 0.
The wholepart is 0.
The fraction is 0.
The marked is empty text.
The allowed is 1.
For every query from 0 to 4.
The start is item query of starts.
The end is item query of ends.
Set wantednode to end.
Set done to 0.
Set foundnum to 0.
Set foundden to 1.
Set item 0 of visited to 0.
Set item 1 of visited to 0.
Set item 2 of visited to 0.
Set item 3 of visited to 0.
Set item 4 of visited to 0.
Set item start of visited to 1.
Set allowed to 1.
If item start of known is 0, set allowed to 0.
If allowed is 1, Seek from start at 1 with 1.
Set rendered to empty text.
If done is 1, set scaled to foundnum times 100000 divided by foundden.
If done is 1, set wholepart to scaled divided by 100000.
If done is 1, set fraction to scaled modulo 100000.
If done is 1, set marked to format whole number wholepart as text.
If done is 1, place marked into rendered.
If done is 1, place "." into rendered.
If done is 1, expand from 10000 with fraction.
If done is 1, show rendered.
If done is 0, show "-1.00000".
